== Usage ==
*<pvxbig> Stay in Spear set between fights, switch to Daggers as you are about to attack;
* Prebuff yourself with {{skill pvxicon|Deadly Haste|16}}, and cover it with {{skill pvxicon|Sharpen Daggers|16}}/{{skill pvxicon|Withering Aura|8}}
* Close gap with {{skill pvxicon|Siphon Speed|4}}
* Keep {{skill pvxicon|Seeping Wound|16}} on your target while pressuring them with {{skill pvxicon|Golden Lotus Strike|13}} → {{skill pvxicon|Golden Fang Strike|16}} → {{skill pvxicon|Critical Strike|16}}
* {{skill pvxicon|Withering Aura|8}} has very low cooldown. Spread the love to your other melee teammates!


== Counters ==
* Anti-melee
* Heavy hex and enchantment removal;

